# CaviCore AI

Decentralized, membrane-free water purification combining hydrodynamic cavitation, Pulsed Electro-Oxidation (PEO), and Edge AI.

## Project Structure
- `/src`: Firmware for ESP32 and TinyML model deployment.
- `/docs`: Technical design documents & architecture diagrams.
- `/data`: Sample telemetry data and test cases.

